1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Welcome to this short workshop.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,600
Open the project folder
and choose a subtitle file.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:14,800
Check the start and end time of each caption.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,000
Read the translated lines while watching the video.

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:25,400
If a sentence is too long, shorten the wording.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,400
Save your subtitles and review them once more.
